      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Short review of exemplary clinical assessment methods to describe clinical evidence-based assessment for patients suffering from symptoms of musculoskeletal pain.History and physical examination are the primary evidence-based assessment instruments for pain patients. Pain scales and questionnaire might allow assessment of different aspects of pain in order to perform an individualized therapy for pain patients."},
